  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling start ups: venture building and investor assessments</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to further grow the most promising start-ups into SMEs through two main elements; 1) venture-building support and 2) through accessing private capital for early stage start-ups . This is a necessary step to increase access to capital and fast growth of the most promising companies, in particular in Kenya and in Uganda. This will help start-ups raise capital from banks or other financial institutions, and attract institutional investment firms and other investors on board for a positive impact. In order for this to happen, the project will further refine the scaling and growth strategies and business model of the start-ups.  This project will cover feasibility studies of venture building and capital access, and training within the same.</narrative>
  </description>
